          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bazen fonksiyonların görevlerini yerine getirmelerine yardımcı olacak belirli bilgilere ihtiyacı olur. Örneğin, bir oyuncunun envanterine öğe ekleyen bir fonksiyon.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6E6E6;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 18px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #inventoryList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    width: 280px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    height: 28px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Pick Up Loot&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Loot&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;itemInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;iInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Enter an item (e.g., Potion)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;pickUp()&quot;&gt;Pick Up&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Inventory&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=&quot;inventoryList&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let slotsUsed = 0;&#xA;   function pickUp() {&#xA;    if (slotsUsed &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Inventory Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const item = document.getElementById(&quot;iInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Picked up: &quot; + item);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;inventoryList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     slotsUsed++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başlangıç olarak, fonksiyonların içinde sabitleri kullanabiliriz. Örneğin <code> const item = \"Potion\";</code> oluşturarak onu görüntüleme ifadesinde kullanabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>item</code> ve sonra <code>=</code>, <code>\"Potion\"</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Başka bir öğeyi nasıl alırdık? Benzer kodla yeni bir <code>pickUpKey();</code> fonksiyonu oluşturup çağırabiliriz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"198\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpKey\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpKey();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>pickUpKey()</code>, ardından <code>pickUpKey()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İki fonksiyon yazmak yerine, kodu tekrarlamadan belirli bilgileri yalnızca bir fonksiyona aktarabiliriz. İşte kısa bir bakış.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"</code>, ardından <code>Key</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
