            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametre, bir değeri depolayan değişken gibi davranır. Ancak henüz içinde bir değer yok.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>item</code>, ardından <code>item</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
