            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>addScoreBonus</code> fonksiyon adını ve <code>score</code> parametresini ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = score / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonus);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>addScoreBonus</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>score</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
